# Crypto Signal Bot v9

Signal-only Binance → Telegram. No auto-trading. No private Binance APIs.

## Read first (token budget)

1. [docs/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md](docs/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md) — v1 done vs open backlog
2. [docs/AGENT_TOKEN_POLICY.md](docs/AGENT_TOKEN_POLICY.md) — do not re-read whole repo
3. [AGENT_QUICK_START.md](AGENT_QUICK_START.md) — hot paths only when coding

**Do not** spawn «50 improvements» lists. Update backlog table in DEFINITION_OF_DONE only.

## Solo operator

Human: direction + acceptance. Agent: all execution. [docs/SOLO_OPERATOR_PLAYBOOK.md](docs/SOLO_OPERATOR_PLAYBOOK.md)

## Commands

```bash
make check
make validate-config
python main.py run
python main.py harvest --minutes 120   # research capture, no Telegram
```

Calibration last: `BOT_ALLOW_CALIBRATION=1 python scripts/calibration_pipeline.py`

## Delivery invariant

`validate_signal_contract` → `hard_confluence_gate` (3-of-5) → `delivery.deliver`

## graphify

`graphify query "<q>"` before grep if `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.

## Subagents

`orchestrator`, `live-ops`, `de-bloat`, `strategy-calibration`, `delivery-guardian`, `verifier`

## LLM APIs

Not on hot path. See [docs/research/LLM_API_INTEGRATION.md](docs/research/LLM_API_INTEGRATION.md).
